<p class="govuk-body">You need to ask for permission from <a class="govuk-link" href="/probation-officer" data-tracking-id="requirement_help_residence_probation_officer_link">your probation officer</a> if you want to stay:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  <li>at a known temporary address</li>
  <li>somewhere new</li>
</ul>
<p class="govuk-body">You need to tell your probation officer if you are at risk of becoming homeless.</p>
